# Origin and authorship

This repository continues Eric Ahlqvist's `Massey-pari`, the PARI/GP code
base that grew out of the computations accompanying Ahlqvist--Carlson.  It
is not a copy: the git history of this repository *is* his history with
later work on top.  Commits up to and including `337fca9` (2025-01-16 to
2026-02-09) are by Eric Ahlqvist; everything from `bb30c99` (2026-07-23)
onwards is by Denis Vogel.  `git log` shows the boundary directly.

Both parts are distributed under the MIT license reproduced in `LICENSE`,
which now carries both copyright notices.

## Eric Ahlqvist's part

The arithmetic core, which constructs unramified cyclic extensions, their
automorphisms and Artin symbols, and searches for the auxiliary
Ahlqvist--Carlson data:

```text
src/artin_symbol.c      headers/artin_symbol.h
src/ext_and_aut.c       headers/ext_and_aut.h
src/find_cup_matrix.c   headers/find_cup_matrix.h
src/misc_functions.c    headers/misc_functions.h
src/massey.c
Makefile
```

These files have since been extended (about 1200 added and 110 removed
lines across them), chiefly to allow a character to be prescribed and to
return the resulting secondary norm operator in fixed class-group
coordinates.

## Denis Vogel's part

New modules in the same tree:

```text
src/secondary_norm.c      headers/secondary_norm.h
src/massey_tensor.c       headers/massey_tensor.h
src/relation_degree3.c    headers/relation_degree3.h
src/example_pipeline.c    headers/example_pipeline.h
src/candidate_scanner.c   headers/candidate_scanner.h
                          headers/pari_internal.h
```

and the following directories in their entirety:

```text
certificates/      the stored arithmetic certificates
verifier/          the standalone verifier and its rejection tests
records/           result records, run logs, transverse certificates
census/            the discriminant lists and their provenance
tools/             batch runners, Groebner and Singular drivers,
                   transverse rank-one certification, table readers
cm-constructor/    the CM class-field constructor
parallelization/   per-character parallel drivers
worksheets/        the worksheet parts W1--W6
tests/             regression tests
doc/               the PARI patch documentation
REPRODUCING.md
```

## Third-party components

The build requires a one-file patch of stock PARI 2.17.4 (three functions
made non-static), documented in `doc/pari-2.17.4-patch.md`.  No PARI source
is redistributed here.
